<title>USA: Charlotte County, Fla., yields 5.30 pct in 2011.</title>
<headline>Charlotte County, Fla., yields 5.30 pct in 2011.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons Inc said it priced $9.150 million of Charlotte County, Fla., solid waste disposal system revenue refunding bonds with a top yield of 5.30 percent in 2011.</p>
</text>
